<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $54 (FIM 249.90).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS AT $54 (FIM 249.90).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed flat at $54 in New York on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 249.90 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Tuesday, Nokia A closed down 6.50 markka at 248.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed down $0-1/4 at $33-7/8 on Wall Street on Tuesday. The price equals about 78.40 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet fell 0.40 markka to close at 78.60 markka.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR closed down $0-3/4 at $18-1/4 in New York on Tuesday. The price corresponds to about 84.40 markka. In Helsinki, Rauma closed 0.90 lower at 89.10 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
